liability partnership including professional corporations. For Hong Kong office, a limited liability partnership.</FONT></P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in"><B></B></P>

