<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">eg. Changde-Tax adjustments-business
entertainment expenses</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">1. Operating income for the period CNY
34,889,692.60</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">2. Credit limit (A)=CNY 34,889,692.60<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&times;</FONT>0.5%=CNY
174,448.46</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">3. Actual amount of business entertainment
expenses for the period CNY 52,700.00</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">4. Deduction limit (B)=CNY 52,700.00<FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&times;</FONT>60%=CNY
31,620.00</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in">Adjustment of business entertainment expenses: CNY
52,700.00-lower of (A) and (B) CNY 31,620.00= CNY 21,080.00</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">Prior-year tax adjustments from the
2024 final settlement (October 2023 to December 2023): $189,232</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">Deferred tax on unrecognized domestic
company losses: $783,114.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.4in; text-indent: -0.4in">&nbsp;</P>


